# zhixin

AUR package for 致信 (ZhiXin), an enterprise instant messaging client.

## Installation

### 1. Download the source

Download `UOS_Hygon.zip` from https://zhixin.seeyon.com (select "UOS+海光 V8.0")
and place it in this directory.

### 2. Install gconf (AUR dependency)

```bash
yay -S --asdeps gconf
```

> **Note:** AUR packages cannot be auto-installed as dependencies by makepkg.

### 3. Build and install

```bash
makepkg -si
```
